380	guest_1766145885398_obhhbq62z	2025-12-19 12:21:28.193123	is capsule ke sath kya diet plan lena chahiye	[Soothe-Up Capsules](https://naturemania.in/products/soothe-up-capsule) ke sath ek balanced diet follow karna zaroori hai jisse aapke overall wellness ko support mile. Yahan kuch dietary suggestions diye gaye hain:\n\n1. **Fruits and Vegetables:** Har din different colors ke fruits aur vegetables shamil karein. Ye antioxidants, vitamins, aur minerals se bharpoor hote hain.\n\n2. **Whole Grains:** Jaise brown rice, quinoa, aur whole grain bread lein. Ye energy level ko maintain karne mein madad karte hain.\n\n3. **Protein Sources:** Lean proteins use karein jaise lentils, beans, chicken, fish, ya tofu. Protein stress ko manage karne aur mood ko enhance karne mein madad karte hain.\n\n4. **Healthy Fats:** Nuts, seeds, olive oil, aur avocados ko apni diet mein shamil karein. Healthy fats brain function ke liye achhe hote hain.\n\n5. **Hydration:** Rozana kafi pani peeje, jaise 8-10 glass. Hydration mood aur energy levels ko improve karta hai.\n\n6. **Avoid Processed Foods:** Jyada sugar, caffeine, aur processed foods se bachein, kyunki ye stress ko badha sakte hain.\n\n**Additional Tips:**\n- Aapne din ka shuruaat ek healthy breakfast se karein.\n- Regular meals lene ki koshish karein taaki energy levels balanced rahein.\n- Exercise ko apni routine mein shamil karein, jaise walking ya yoga, jo stress ko kam karne mein madadgar hota hai.\n\nKoi aur specific dietary advice chahiye ho toh hume batayein! Aur aap [Soothe-Up Capsules](https://naturemania.in/products/soothe-up-capsule) ko yahan check kar sakte hain: [Soothe-Up Capsules](https://naturemania.in/products/soothe-up-capsule)	f	\N	["products_general_wellness.txt", "products_women_wellness.txt", "https://naturemania.in/products/nature-mania-smart-shaping-tablets"]	\N	\N
381	guest_1766145885398_obhhbq62z	2025-12-19 12:22:25.4112	isme kon sa khana avoid karna chahiye	[Soothe-Up Capsules](https://naturemania.in/products/soothe-up-capsule) ke sath kuch foods ko avoid karne se aapke overall wellness ko behtar banaya ja sakta hai. Yahan kuch suggestions hain:\n\n1. **Processed Foods:** Jisme high sugar, unhealthy fats, aur preservatives hote hain. Ye aapke mood aur energy levels par negative asar daal sakte hain.\n\n2. **Sugary Snacks and Beverages:** Ye aapke energy levels ko spike karte hain, lekin baad mein crash bhi de sakte hain. Isse stress aur anxiety ka level badh sakta hai.\n\n3. **Caffeine:** Zyada chai, coffee, ya energy drinks se bachein, kyunki ye stress ko badha sakte hain aur neend ko prabhavit kar sakte hain.\n\n4. **Spicy Foods:** Agar aapko stomach issues ya acidity hoti hai, toh bahut spicy foods ka istemal nahi karna chahiye, kyunki ye discomfort create kar sakta hai.\n\n5. **High-Sodium Foods:** Processed aur fast foods jisme sodium zyada hota hai, unse bachein, kyunki ye high blood pressure aur water retention mein madad karte hain.\n\n6. **Alcohol:** Excessive alcohol consumption mood swings aur anxiety badha sakta hai, toh isse avoid karna achha rahega.\n\n7. **Refined Carbohydrates:** White bread, pastries, aur sugary cereals se bachein, kyunki ye aapke blood sugar levels ko affect kar sakte hain.\n\nAapke liye kya best hoga, ye aapki personal health conditions aur lifestyle par depend karta hai. Agar aapko tailored advice chahiye, toh ek healthcare professional se sampark karna accha rahega. \n\nKoi aur sawal ho toh zaroor poochiye! Aur aap [Soothe-Up Capsules](https://naturemania.in/products/soothe-up-capsule) ko yahan check kar sakte hain: [Soothe-Up Capsules](https://naturemania.in/products/soothe-up-capsule)	f	\N	["https://naturemania.in/products/lift-up-gummies-imli-flavour-60n", "https://naturemania.in/products/lift-up-massage-oil", "https://naturemania.in/products/lift-up-gold-herbal-massage-oil-for-men"]