896	test_condition_001	2025-12-20 23:37:41.952266	What is the difference between Fair and Superb condition?	**Great question!** Let’s look at the differences between **Fair** and **Superb** conditions for our refurbished [iPhones](https://grest.in/collections/iphones):\n\n### **Fair Condition:**\n- **Appearance:** Noticeable scratches, scuffs, or signs of use. There may be cosmetic wear on the body and screen.\n- **Battery Health:** Minimum 80% battery health.\n- **Performance:** Fully functional and passes all necessary diagnostics.\n\n### **Superb Condition:**\n- **Appearance:** Near-mint condition with minimal signs of use. You might see very light scratches that are barely noticeable.\n- **Battery Health:** Battery health is typically above 85%.\n- **Performance:** Fully functional and like-new, passing all diagnostics without any issues.\n\nIn short, if you’re looking for a device that looks and performs almost like new, go for **Superb condition**. If you want a more budget-friendly option with slight cosmetic wear and solid performance, **Fair condition** will work well!\n\nIf you have any specific models in mind, feel free to ask! 😊\n\n---\n\n*For more details or to explore your options, you can check:*  \n[iPhones](https://grest.in/collections/iphones) | [All Products](https://grest.in/collections/all) | [About Us](https://grest.in/pages/about)\n\n---\n\n*Here are some helpful links:*\n[iPhones](https://grest.in/collections/iphones) | [All Products](https://grest.in/collections/all) | [MacBooks](https://grest.in/collections/macbook)	f	\N	["https://grest.in/blogs/news/refurbished-iphone-conditions-fair-good-superb", "https://grest.in/blogs/news/trade-in-vs-buying-a-refurbished-iphone-which-route-gives-you-better-value", "https://grest.in/pages/faqs"]	\N	\N
897	test_condition_002	2025-12-20 23:38:08.640632	Fair condition mein kya milta hai?	Fair condition mein aapko kuch accha aur budget-friendly options milte hain! 😊 Yahan kuch key features hain jo Fair condition phones ke baare mein jaanna chahiye:\n\n- **Cosmetic Condition:** Visible scratches, scuffs ya wear marks hote hain. Aesthetic flaws hain, par functionality pe koi impact nahi hota.\n- **Battery Health:** Minimum 80% battery health hoti hai.\n- **Performance:** Fully functional hote hain, sabhi hardware diagnostics pass karte hain.\n\nYeh phones sabhi basic features aur performance provide karte hain, lekin appearance pe focus nahi karte. Agar aapko ek reliable aur affordable device chahiye, toh Fair condition phones ka option best hai!\n\nAgar aapko specific products dekhne hain, toh hamaare pass kuch options hain:\n\n- **Apple [iPhones](https://grest.in/collections/iphones) 7 (32GB):** ₹7,800\n\n[View iPhone 7](https://grest.in/products/apple-iphone-7-refurbished?variant=47836027551975)\n\nKya aapko aur koi madad chahiye ya specific product dekhna hai?\n\n---\n\n*You might also like to check:*\n[iPhones](https://grest.in/collections/iphones) | [All Products](https://grest.in/collections/all) | [MacBooks](https://grest.in/collections/macbook)	f	\N	["https://grest.in/blogs/news/best-time-season-to-buy-a-refurbished-iphone-in-india-festival-deals-to-year-end-discounts", "https://grest.in/blogs/news/trade-in-vs-buying-a-refurbished-iphone-which-route-gives-you-better-value", "https://grest.in/blogs/news/refurbished-iphone-conditions-fair-good-superb"]	\N	\N
