1092	test_faq_007	2025-12-21 01:00:29.380662	Fair aur superb condition mein kya farak hai?	Great question! 😊 Fair aur superb condition ke beech mein kuch important differences hain:\n\n### **Fair Condition:**\n- **Cosmetic Condition:** Noticeable scratches, scuffs, or visible wear; marks on the frame or screen are clearly visible.\n- **Battery Health:** 80% and above.\n- **Performance:** Fully functional, but appearance may not be perfect. Yeh condition un logon ke liye best hai jo budget-conscious hain aur sirf reliable device chahte hain.\n\n### **Superb Condition:**\n- **Cosmetic Condition:** Appears almost new; may have extremely faint, hardly noticeable hairline scratches; no dents or major signs of previous use.\n- **Battery Health:** 85% and above.\n- **Performance:** 100% functional, passes every diagnostic test. Yeh condition un logon ke liye hai jo premium experience chahte hain ya kisi ko gift dena chahte hain.\n\nIn summary, **Fair Condition** devices have more visible wear but are still fully functional, while **Superb Condition** devices look almost new and are in better cosmetic shape. Kya aapko kisi specific device mein interest hai? 😊\n\n---\n\n*Here are some helpful links:*\n[All Products](https://grest.in/collections/all) | [iPhones](https://grest.in/collections/iphones) | [MacBooks](https://grest.in/collections/macbook)	f	\N	["grest_product_catalog.txt", "https://grest.in/blogs/news/best-time-season-to-buy-a-refurbished-iphone-in-india-festival-deals-to-year-end-discounts", "https://grest.in/blogs/news/trade-in-vs-buying-a-refurbished-iphone-which-route-gives-you-better-value"]	\N	\N
1093	test_faq_008	2025-12-21 01:00:47.7203	What is the difference between Good and Superb condition?	Sure! Here's the breakdown of the differences between **Good** and **Superb** condition for our refurbished devices:\n\n### **Good Condition:**\n- **Cosmetic Condition:** Light signs of use, may have minor scratches or scuffs that are barely noticeable.\n- **Battery Health:** 80% and above.\n- **Performance:** Fully functional with no impact on speed, camera, or overall functionality.\n- **Best for:** Everyday users and budget-conscious buyers who want reliability at a lower price.\n\n### **Superb Condition:**\n- **Cosmetic Condition:** Like-new appearance with minimal to no visible wear; may have extremely faint, hardly noticeable hairline scratches.\n- **Battery Health:** 85% and above.\n- **Performance:** Excellent, smooth performance, fully functional.\n- **Best for:** Buyers seeking a premium experience, long-term use, or gifting purposes without paying full price for a new device.\n\nBoth condition types ensure you receive a high-quality product with our thorough quality checks! If you have any specific device in mind, let us know and we can provide more details!\n\n---\n\n*Browse more options here:*\n[All Products](https://grest.in/collections/all) | [iPhones](https://grest.in/collections/iphones) | [MacBooks](https://grest.in/collections/macbook)	f	\N	["https://grest.in/blogs/news/refurbished-iphone-conditions-fair-good-superb", "https://grest.in/pages/faqs", "https://grest.in/blogs/news/trade-in-vs-buying-a-refurbished-iphone-which-route-gives-you-better-value"]	\N	\N
