1304	guest_1766476148213_3i3r69vqs	2025-12-23 07:55:50.396498	Should I go for pro or normal iPhone 15	Choosing between the [iPhones](https://grest.in/collections/iphones) 15 Pro and the regular iPhone 15 depends on your needs and preferences. Here’s a breakdown to help you decide which one might be best for you:\n\n### **iPhone 15 Pro**\n![iPhone 15 Pro](https://grest.in/images/product/iphone-15-pro.png)\n- **Camera Setup:** Triple camera system (including a telephoto lens) for more versatile photography, especially great for portraits and enhanced zoom.\n- **Material:** Premium stainless steel frame, which is more durable and gives a premium feel.\n- **Display:** ProMotion technology for a smoother experience with a 120Hz refresh rate.\n- **Performance:** Comes with the latest A17 Bionic chip for better performance in demanding tasks.\n- **Additional Features:** Enhanced durability and water resistance, plus features like ProRAW for professional-grade photo editing.\n\n### **Regular iPhone 15**\n![iPhone 15](https://grest.in/images/product/iphone-15.png)\n- **Camera Setup:** Dual camera system (wide and ultra-wide) that still captures excellent photos.\n- **Material:** Lightweight aluminum frame which is still quite durable.\n- **Display:** Super Retina XDR display (but without ProMotion).\n- **Performance:** Equipped with the A16 Bionic chip, which is powerful and can handle most tasks efficiently.\n- **Cost:** Generally more affordable than the Pro model.\n\n### **Considerations:**\n- **Photography Needs:** If you are an photography enthusiast who takes lots of photos, the Pro version is definitely better due to its advanced camera capabilities.\n  \n- **Price Sensitivity:** If budget is a significant factor, the regular iPhone 15 offers fantastic features for a lower price.\n\n- **Usage**: Are you looking for advanced features and performance, or would you be satisfied with the standard features of the iPhone 15?\n\nUltimately, if photography and top-notch performance are your priorities, go for the **iPhone 15 Pro**. However, if you still want a great device that performs well without the extra features, the **regular iPhone 15** should be more than sufficient! \n\nIf you need specific pricing or wish to explore the models further, just let me know! 😊\n\n---\n\n*Explore more options:*\n[iPhone 15 Pro](https://grest.in/products/refurbished-apple-iphone-15-pro) | [iPhone 15](https://grest.in/products/refurbished-apple-iphone-15) | [All Products](https://grest.in/collections/all)\n\n---\n\n*Feel free to explore more:*\n[iPhones](https://grest.in/collections/iphones) | [All Products](https://grest.in/collections/all)	f	\N	["https://grest.in/blogs/news/best-refurbished-iphone-deals-year-end-sale-2025", "https://grest.in/collections/iphones.oembed", "https://grest.in/blogs/news/best-time-season-to-buy-a-refurbished-iphone-in-india-festival-deals-to-year-end-discounts"]	\N	\N
